{
  "path": "/detail",
  "title": "개요",
  "desc": "메뉴와 탭을 따라가며 보는 작업 방법",
  "toc": [],
  "html": "<p>기능 가이드는 화면에 보이는 순서를 그대로 따라갑니다. <strong>메뉴 → 탭 → 작업</strong> 세 단계여서,\n찾는 화면이 어느 메뉴에 있는지만 알면 왼쪽 목차에서 바로 짚을 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p>처음이라면 <a href=\"#/onboarding\">시작하기</a>에서 그룹·역할·워크스페이스 개념을 먼저 보고 오시는 편이 빠릅니다.</p>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container\"><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/organization\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">조직 관리</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>그룹과 구성원, 역할권한 구성, 전체 조직도</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/security\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">보안</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>개인정보 마스킹 — 패턴 라이브러리와 그룹별 적용 정책</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/llmops\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">LLMOps</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>모델 거버넌스(카탈로그·정책·사용 설정), 모델서빙</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workspace\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">워크스페이스</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>스페이스 만들기와 멤버 관리, 변경이력</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">워크플로우</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>빌더, 배포, 로그, 버전, 테이블, 템플릿, 설정</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/ragops\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">RAGOps</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>외부 연결, Data Library, RAG Space</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/playground\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">플레이그라운드</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>프롬프트 작성과 시험</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/ontology\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">온톨로지</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>노드·엣지 설계, 문서에서 데이터 추출, Cypher 질의</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/chatbot-hub\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">챗봇 허브</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>챗봇 사용, 신청 현황, 시스템 챗봇 관리</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/announcements\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">공지사항</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>공지 작성과 관리</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/model-usage-stats\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">모델 사용량 통계</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>비용과 사용량 분석, 데이터 내보내기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/agent-status\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">에이전트 현황</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>워크플로우의 배포 상태와 마지막 실행 시점 조회</p></div></a></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>위쪽 <strong>역할별 보기</strong>에서 조직관리자 · 그룹관리자 · 그룹원을 고르면, 그 역할이 쓸 수 없는\n문서를 목차에서 감춥니다. 읽기 편하라고 거르는 것이지 접근 권한과는 다릅니다.</p></div></div></div>"
}